{"sections":[{"slug":"动量映射","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"动量映射"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">动量映射</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"动量映射"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">使用动量映射</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">我们可以根据群作用的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">守恒量</span></strong> (conserved quantities) <span lang=\"zh\">得到</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">可观测量</span></strong> (observables).</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3>Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">流形上的作用</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Poisson流形","text":"Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">上有一</span> Hamilton <span lang=\"zh\">作用</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即存在</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数同态</span> $h_{-} \\colon \\mathfrak{g} \\to C^\\infty(M)$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> $x\\in \\mathfrak{g}$ <span lang=\"zh\">在作用之下对应的</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的向量场等同于</span> $h_x$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Poisson流形","text":"Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">括号</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">下对应的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/导子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">导子</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\{-,h_x\\}$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">此时</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">映射</span> $h_{-}$ <span lang=\"zh\">也给出一个映射</span> $\\mu \\colon M\\to\\mathfrak g^*$, <span lang=\"zh\">称之为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">动量映射</span></strong> (moment map, <span lang=\"zh\">或</span> momentum map).</p>\n<h3>Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">代数上的作用</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">动量映射可以绕过流形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">直接在代数层面谈论</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">设代数群</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">作用于</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Poisson代数","text":"Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $P$, <span lang=\"zh\">且存在</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数同态</span> $h\\colon \\mathfrak{g} \\to P$ <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> $x\\in \\mathfrak{g}$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应的</span> $P$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/导子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">导子</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">恰为</span> $\\{-,h_x\\}$. <span lang=\"zh\">那么映射</span> $h$ <span lang=\"zh\">本身即是动量映射</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数-几何对偶","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">几何对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">另一侧的对应物</span>).</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">这种观点与</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/量子动量映射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">量子动量映射</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">直接相关</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p>Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数同态</span> $h_{-} \\colon \\mathfrak{g} \\to C^\\infty(M)$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Poisson代数","text":"Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">同态</span>\n$\\operatorname{Sym}\\mathfrak{g} \\to C^\\infty(M)$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">等变</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">为连通</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">考虑</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $\\mathfrak{g}^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的余伴随作用</span> $\\operatorname{Ad}^*$, <span lang=\"zh\">则动量映射</span> $\\mu \\colon M \\to \\mathfrak{g}^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">等变映射</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">证明</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">由连通性</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">只需证明无穷小版本的结论</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $x\\in\\mathfrak{g}$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应的</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的向量场为</span> $\\xi_x$, <span lang=\"zh\">而余伴随作用</span> $\\operatorname{Ad}^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应的</span> $\\mathfrak{g}$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $\\mathfrak{g}^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的作用为</span> $\\operatorname{ad}^*$,\n$$\r\n\\langle\\operatorname{ad}^*_x(\\alpha),y\\rangle = -\\alpha([x,y])\\,(x,y\\in\\mathfrak{g},\\alpha\\in\\mathfrak{g}^*).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">我们要证明的结论是</span>\n$$\r\nd_m\\mu (\\xi_x) = \\operatorname{ad}_x^*(\\mu(m))\\,(m\\in M).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">而这只需将两边与</span> $y\\in\\mathfrak{g}$ <span lang=\"zh\">配对</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">使用</span> $h_{-}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的性质计算</span>\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n    \\langle d_m \\mu (\\xi_x),y\\rangle &amp;=\r\n    d_m h_y (\\xi_x)\\\\\r\n    &amp;= -\\{h_x,h_y\\}(m)\\\\\r\n    &amp;= -h_{[x,y]}(m)\\\\\r\n    &amp;= -\\mu(m)([x,y])= \\langle \\operatorname{ad}_x^*(\\mu(m)),y \\rangle.\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/量子动量映射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">量子动量映射</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Delzant多面体","text":"Delzant <span lang=\"zh\">多面体</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}